<title>USA: Market Facts Inc Q1 net, revenues rise.</title>
<headline>Market Facts Inc Q1 net, revenues rise.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON HEIGHTS, Ill. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>THREE MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>						   3/31/97	 3/31/96*</p>
<p>INCOME STATEMENT</p>
<p> Revenue					 $21,581	  $18,659</p>
<p> Income from operations			1,697	    1,155</p>
<p> Income before income taxes		  1,455		964</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes		    620		436</p>
<p> Net income					  835		528</p>
<p> Earnings per share				.23		.14</p>
