<p>   shares outstanding		    3,557,974	3,880,204</p>
<p>		  (in thousands except share data)</p>
<p>*  Per share amounts restated for two-for-one split in the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
